  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as&nbsp;<strong>Assertion A</strong> and the other is labelled as <strong>Reason R</strong></p><p><strong>Assertion A :</strong> The nuclear density of nuclides&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>B</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>5</mn><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>L</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>F</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>26</mn><mn>56</mn></mmultiscripts><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>N</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></mmultiscripts><mi>e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>B</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>83</mn><mn>209</mn></mmultiscripts><mi>i</mi></math>&nbsp;can be arranged as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>&#961;</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mo>&#62;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#961;</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mo>&#62;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#961;</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mo>&#62;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mo>&#62;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#961;</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><strong>Reason R :</strong> The radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> of nucleus is related to its mass number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> is a constant.</p><p>In the light of the above statement, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "IOsqc",
      "text": "Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A",
